WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:06.000
[Soft instrumental music]
Introducing Sys1. Review changes. Check completion claims.

00:06.000 --> 00:12.000
Give your coding agent a repeatable check.
Repository rules and change evidence form a focused question.

00:12.000 --> 00:20.000
Review a change against your repository's rules.
Select evidence, preview the request, and investigate advisory findings.

00:20.000 --> 00:28.000
A supported session transcript shows one failed test,
contradicting the claim “All tests passed.”

00:28.000 --> 00:35.000
Typed decisions for your application:
yes/no, choice, and score, with validated answers through one API.

00:35.000 --> 00:42.000
Choose hosted Jev, TypeSafe's decision model; experimental local Qwen;
or your compatible server. Hosted Jev is opt-in.

00:42.000 --> 00:46.000
Failure triage. Excerpt relevance. Claim support.
Source-checkout experiments.

00:46.000 --> 00:52.000
Introducing Sys1. Review changes and check completion claims.
sys1.io. MIT source.
